Number of recursive calls: 4
```

This program uses the Euclidean algorithm to find the GCD recursively. The recursive calls count is incremented every time the `gcd()` function is called. The time complexity of this program is O(log min(x, y)) and the space complexity is O(log min(x, y)), where min(x, y) is the smaller of the two given numbers.

